<h2>TIC01</h2>

<p>Text element with optional media content. Often used within accordion (ACC01) or slider (SLI01b) elements.</p>

<p><strong>Possible placement:</strong></p>
<ul>
    <li>Content zone</li>
    <li>Margin column</li>
</ul>

<p><strong>Options:</strong></p>
<ul>
    <li>Alignment</li>
    <li>With or without headline and subheadline</li>
    <li>With or without image or video</li>
    <li>Download link for image</li>
    <li>Zoomable image</li>
    <li>Expandable text</li>
    <li>With or without CTA button</li>
    <li>CTA button color and full width</li>
</ul>

